exports[`wishlist copy: what the plugin says about itself > help through the intent model, and a message it can't read 1`] = `
{
  "asked": [],
  "groups": [],
  "reactions": [],
  "sent": [
    {
      "group": null,
      "ref": null,
      "text": "*Wishlist*

Send a link to something you want and I keep it with its name, picture and price. Or type it: _running shoes 4000_.

_list_ shows what's left to buy, with the total
_bought_ shows what you already got
_undo_ removes the last thing you added

On something you added: react ✅ once you've bought it, or with anything else (❤️, ⭐) to mark it your own way. Reply to it with a price, a note, a _#label_, _move_ or _delete_. Reply _read again_ and I read its link once more.

_new list diwali_ starts another list in this chat. After that, _diwali_ before a link puts it there, and a link on its own goes to the list you used last.
_new group diwali_ gives a list a WhatsApp group of its own
_lists_ shows every list you have

_share_ gives you a link to this list that anyone can open. _stop sharing_ closes it.

Everything is on app.whatodo.today too, with pictures.",
    },
  ],
  "unsures": [
    "I didn't get that. Send a link to something you want, or type it with its price, like _running shoes 4000_. Send _help_ for more.",
  ],
}
`;

exports[`wishlist copy: what the plugin says about itself > welcome, help and group name 1`] = `
{
  "groupName": "🎁 Wishlist",
  "help": "*Wishlist*

Send a link to something you want and I keep it with its name, picture and price. Or type it: _running shoes 4000_.

_list_ shows what's left to buy, with the total
_bought_ shows what you already got
_undo_ removes the last thing you added

On something you added: react ✅ once you've bought it, or with anything else (❤️, ⭐) to mark it your own way. Reply to it with a price, a note, a _#label_, _move_ or _delete_. Reply _read again_ and I read its link once more.

_new list diwali_ starts another list in this chat. After that, _diwali_ before a link puts it there, and a link on its own goes to the list you used last.
_new group diwali_ gives a list a WhatsApp group of its own
_lists_ shows every list you have

_share_ gives you a link to this list that anyone can open. _stop sharing_ closes it.

Everything is on app.whatodo.today too, with pictures.",
  "welcome": "🎁 You've added *Wishlist*.

Send a link to something you want, or type it with its price: _running shoes 4000_. I'll keep the list and the total.

Send _help_ for more.",
}
`;
